  · CINEMATIC RHYTHM DRIFT (HARD — modulates the system prompt's beat-count + expression-peak bounds within their allowed ranges):
      – BEAT COUNT for this scene: aim for the LOWER end of the system prompt's beat range (fewer, denser beats). Goal-heavy rhythm is dense and forward-moving; the scene moves through its moments rather than holding them.
